request.description:
Nested pay-run header + employees[].lines[]. Optional employee_id filters to one employee.

Example success:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "payRun": { "payRunId": 103, "runStatus": "COMPLETED", "processPeriod": "AUGUST 2026" },
    "employees": [{ "employeeId": 501, "lines": [{ "componentId": 10, "amount": 1500, "processStatus": "COMPLETED" }] }]
  },
  "pagination": { "page": 1, "limit": 50, "total": 9, "total_pages": 1, "has_next": false, "has_previous": false }
}

404 Pay run not found | 404 Employee not found in the specified pay run

Example success:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "payRun": { "payRunId": 103, "runType": "PAYROLL", "runStatus": "COMPLETED", "processPeriod": "AUGUST 2026" },
    "employee": { "employeeId": 501, "lines": [] }
  }
}

One record per employee. totalAmount is the sum of line amounts, not net salary.

Example success:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [{ "employeeId": 501, "totalLines": 8, "totalAmount": 2500.75, "completedLines": 8, "failedLines": 0 }]
}

PROCESS_STATUS = FAILED. Each row includes errorMessage.

Example success:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [{ "employeeId": 502, "componentId": 10, "processStatus": "FAILED", "errorMessage": "Missing assignment amount" }]
}

Distinct pay runs in which the employee has at least one line.

Example success:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [{ "payRunId": 103, "runType": "PAYROLL", "runStatus": "COMPLETED", "processPeriod": "AUGUST 2026", "processPeriodCode": "2026-08" }]
}
